== Description ==
Grants a passive ability which makes {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Furious Strike}} grant Spellcasts for incantation spells.

== Details ==
Every {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Furious Strike}} cast grants:
<br><math>B^R + 1</math>
spellcasts for each incantation spell on the panel.
<br>In Defense Stance:
<br><math>B^R \times 3 + 3</math>

where :
* <math>B = \text{Current Amount of Monuments}</math>
* <math>R = \frac{1 + 0.75 \times \text{Tier}}{4} \times 0.4</math>

Tiers:
* <math>\text{Common} = 0</math>
* <math>\text{Uncommon} = 1</math>
* <math>\text{Rare} = 2</math>
* <math>\text{Epic} = 3</math>
* <math>\text{Legendary} = 4</math>
* <math>\text{Unique} = 4</math>

